        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your companion is a khefak, a hardy, insectile creature common on Akiton that consumes scrap.</p>\n<p><strong>Support Benefit</strong> Your khefak gnaws on a creature's gear. If your target has a shield raised, its shield is no longer raised. In addition, until the end of your next turn, if you attempt to Disarm, Shove, or Trip a creature within your khefak's melee reach and you roll a critical failure, you get a failure instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Maneuver</strong> @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.companion-types.Item.Grab and Gnaw]{Grab and Gnaw}</p>"
